{
  "matches": [
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n1",
        "action:n2"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "To start the process, Course Packet Information Received should be sent"
      ],
      "justification": "Covers the implicit process start, the explicit 'start' step, and the initial send action."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n3",
        "action:n4"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "followed by sending the Design to Faculty. After sending the Design to Faculty, the Faculty will choose the design."
      ],
      "justification": "Directly maps to sending the design and the subsequent faculty choice."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n5",
        "action:n6"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Next, identify the content that requires copyright clearance and contact the publisher to obtain clearance."
      ],
      "justification": "Splits the compound instruction into two corresponding action nodes."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n7",
        "action:n8"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If there is a need to \"Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added\", then the process should be continued."
      ],
      "justification": "Captures the conditional check (modeled as an action step), the XOR split, and the specific contact faculty action on the denial path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n9"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "However, if the \"Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared\", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost."
      ],
      "justification": "Exact paraphrase of the cost calculation step on the cleared path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n10"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "After calculating the Course Packet Cost, the MPC should add the Bookstore margin to determine the retail price."
      ],
      "justification": "Faithfully restates the margin addition and price determination step."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n11",
        "action:n12"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price, then the process should be continued."
      ],
      "justification": "Represents the second conditional check (modeled as action), the XOR split, and the reconsideration/continuation path."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n13"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Alternatively, if the Price of the Course Packet is finalized, then the MPC should notify the Bookstore of the Course packet, Course number, Faculty name, and sections."
      ],
      "justification": "Summarizes the detailed notification list into a concise finalization notice, preserving core meaning."
    },
    {
      "refs": [
        "action:n14"
      ],
      "verbatim_texts": [
        "Once the MPC notifies the Bookstore, the Packet information should be notified to the Bookstore, and the process will end."
      ],
      "justification": "Maps the closing notification context and the explicit termination clause to the end action and structural end node."
    }
  ],
